[52.722405, "o", "+    The export may contain multiple rows for the same ``user_id`` because the\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[52.722488, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[52.722661, "o", "+    assignment service retries.  The plan (section 2) states that *exact* repeat\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[52.722746, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[52.722937, "o", "+    rows count once, but rows that differ only in ``assigned_at`` (e.g., a retry\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
